    "intro_html":  "Soto Betawi is Jakarta in a bowl: beef simmered until tender in a coconut and milk broth, built on a fried spice paste of shallot, garlic, cashew, and ginger, then brightened at the table with lime and green onion. It is a soup that eats like a dinner. Each bowl carries \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and {{cal}} calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
